    "rating": 4.4,
    "reference": "ChIJU2zCrWI3yUwR2JX2MRQlWQ0",
    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Alexandra S",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115263387293856156604/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJSD8YqAVspKQoVFDvhGvC5H2YZUX5jVs0fKj2CVIHxFOleEw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "9 months ago",
        "text": "What a lovely vineyard and in our own backyard! We went to celebrate a birthday and it did not disappoint. The wine was wonderful as was the food and the service was fantastic. The owner was so nice and made sure we were having a good time. We will definitely be back :)",
        "time": 1746527684,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Bozena Bortkiewicz",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115172006680778028081/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocI6XtOrtnvzZuajKagx8ScZOBz8YxqZDliIoyX1gxSmiHEtIQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "6 months ago",
        "text": "A magical experience at our doorstep! We were warmly greeted by the owner and advised that we were welcome on the terrace with our Golden. Beautiful setting. We followed Philippe 's recommendations and had the white bubbly crémant with torchon foie gras. Both were wonderful! We will be back for a wine tasting and to try other items on the menu. Would recommend and encourage folks to support this  wonderful local business.",
        "time": 1754230274,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Bethany",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/113519824491262425889/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjW-y90gC3QTRCiSghIaxMag8QnkD-HBtKZcLSffJV-C6w4zqCw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "12 months ago",
        "text": "So perfect I have a winery that is on the island. The place is super cute. The wine is really good. The tasting flights are not expensive. The bottles that you drink on site are also inexpensive as well. They have a little menu for food like charcuterie or warm bread but all in all such a good place the servers are very knowledgeable. I heard that they’re starting tours I think in the summertime so I will certainly be back had so much fun there. I’m sure it’ll be so much better in the summer when their Terras is open, but also it is super beautiful to see in the winter.",
        "time": 1739995637,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Michel Phan Huy",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/108530713355056059777/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUnJcHt3SnBZrlZ6mtFJkxPS3uBw2PAtwvby1R--lIBypwgPhJfwQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba6",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "This is a very new place, a year old. The terrace is beautiful and the vineyards while still young are very promising. We visited with friends to enjoy the scenery while tasting the wine. We had a plate of cheese and delicacies. It was not crowded. What is interesting is this vineyard is on  Montreal island! No need to go far when you only want to enjoy some time out without driving too far! The wine are promising: will have to go back to see how mature will be!",
        "time": 1694353219,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Karen Kennedy",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111886638776423288606/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVoA2521gjLDtVM1mcwi4ExzVQW9G2PjZ393pKhtQgEaSkNHZ2N=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "Spent the afternoon in Senneville at Vignoble Souffle de Vie, the only vineyard on the Island of Montreal that opened to the public in 2022 and the only Quebec winery that produces Merlot. Certified organic, no chemicals or pesticides used to produce their 15 wines. We were greeted by the owner Philippe who was very personable and took us on an impromptu private behind the scenes tour. Interesting to learn the manufacturing process. We had a unique Champagne followed by a wine tasting, foie gras and a Charcuterie board on their terrace overlooking the vineyard was very enjoyable. Clara and Luka were very knowledgeable and attentive servers. I highly recommend a visit, impressive Quebec wines.",
        "time": 1722689615,
        "translated": false
      }
    ],
